Come, come!

521
00:30:59,840 --> 00:31:06,680
How could you have known
that this is where I was?

522
00:31:12,080 --> 00:31:13,480
Instinct.

523
00:31:44,980 --> 00:31:45,810
Ah!

524
00:31:46,140 --> 00:31:47,680
Hold on, what am I doing?

525
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:49,737
I shouldn't be sitting here all relaxed,

526
00:31:49,820 --> 00:31:52,817
just casually sipping tea without
a single care in the world.

527
00:31:52,900 --> 00:31:53,730
Nami, Vivi,

528
00:31:53,813 --> 00:31:57,937
and the others could be waiting out there
right now for me to come and help them.

529
00:31:58,020 --> 00:32:00,549
I am still curious
about one thing, though.

530
00:32:00,780 --> 00:32:05,177
What is a nice, relaxing place like this
doing smack in the middle of an ancient,

531
00:32:05,260 --> 00:32:06,090
creepy jungle?

532
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:09,710
Huh?

533
00:32:16,060 --> 00:32:16,890
What?

534
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:27,900
A transponder snail.

535
00:32:31,860 --> 00:32:33,260
Yeah, hello.

536
00:32:33,780 --> 00:32:35,486
You've reached the crap cafe.

537
00:32:35,820 --> 00:32:37,114
Can I take your order?

538
00:32:41,840 --> 00:32:44,920
You can quit fooling around now, jackass.

539
00:32:47,140 --> 00:32:50,880
Now then, your report's a little
bit late, don't you think?

540
00:32:51,620 --> 00:32:52,450
Huh?

541
00:32:52,560 --> 00:32:54,280
My report, you say?

542
00:32:55,100 --> 00:32:57,960
And to whom exactly am I speaking, please?

543
00:32:59,960 --> 00:33:01,920
Me, Mr. Zero.

544
00:33:11,080 --> 00:33:14,417
There is a treasure I better be found.

545
00:33:14,500 --> 00:33:17,757
The odds that you'll find
it will slip to none!

546
00:33:17,840 --> 00:33:21,097
The world's such a big
place, the oceans are wide.

547
00:33:21,180 --> 00:33:23,237
Don't look at home,
won't help you find it.

548
00:33:23,320 --> 00:33:25,791
Just give up your time, spend on the call.

549
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:28,460
Even so.

550
00:33:31,360 --> 00:33:34,457
If someone tries to keep
us from moving home,

551
00:33:34,540 --> 00:33:37,737
The factor behind our
backs just keeps us strong.

552
00:33:37,820 --> 00:33:41,157
It's too bad cause we're
still selling for it.

553
00:33:41,240 --> 00:33:44,577
So fun for ya, just leave us alone?

554
00:33:44,660 --> 00:33:48,377
It may be foolish,
chasing impossible things.

555
00:33:48,460 --> 00:33:50,917
But I've just gotta try!

556
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:57,057
The crazier the dream, the
more ambition I've gotta need.

557
00:33:57,140 --> 00:34:00,877
It may be for this drive and home.

558
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:04,217
But I know that I've just gotta buy.

559
00:34:04,300 --> 00:34:08,177
The farther the sea, the greater paradise.

560
00:34:08,260 --> 00:34:10,800
We've gotta find!

561
00:34:11,500 --> 00:34:13,577
Don't be about just people trying.

562
00:34:13,660 --> 00:34:15,737
And you see that you've loved you too.

563
00:34:15,820 --> 00:34:18,520
The horizon of your dreams?
